NOTE ON SOURCES AND QUOTATIONS
This repository summarizes and analyzes publicly reported security incidents.
Quotations, figures, and primary-source material referenced herein remain the
property of their respective authors/owners and are used for educational and
defensive-research purposes with attribution (see SOURCES.md). The CC BY 4.0
license above applies to this repository's original written analysis, not to
third-party material it cites or quotes.

NOTE ON PURPOSE
This is defensive security research and education. It describes attack
mechanisms and indicators to aid defenders' understanding. It does not provide
weaponized, ready-to-abuse attack tooling, and contains no malicious code.
